flowchart TD
    A[Prediction is too low] --> B[Need to raise the score]
    B --> C[Gradient marks increase direction]

    D[Prediction is too high] --> E[Need to lower the score]
    E --> F[Gradient marks decrease direction]

    G[Final score is wrong] --> H[Backward responsibility starts]
    H --> I[Last layer gets a signal]
    I --> J[Earlier layers also receive responsibility]
